  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115606",
      "title": "Multi-Element Custom Components & Content Projection",
      "lectureOrder": 110,
      "videoOrder": 104,
      "sourceHash": "12ffa2ddefd788e58fdbc476b24d996677d116fdaba0439eaaf7af298437b813",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.45,
          "end": 3.84,
          "en": "So now that we added a bunch of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.84,
          "end": 7.41,
          "en": "and we played around with ng-content quite a bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.41,
          "end": 11.13,
          "en": "there is another reusable component I wanna add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.13,
          "end": 12.27,
          "en": "to this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.27,
          "end": 16.35,
          "en": "And that's a component that should deal with those inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.35,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "because again, here we have a similar shape of markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "which we're reusing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "Now, of course, we're only using it in two places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 28.65,
          "en": "and you definitely don't need to start creating components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.65,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "for every piece of markup that looks similar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 36.18,
          "en": "But since we're in a course and for practice purposes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.18,
          "end": 37.35,
          "en": "and to also dive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.35,
          "end": 40.56,
          "en": "into some other more advanced Angular features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 44.28,
          "en": "I will create yet another reusable component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.28,
          "end": 48.51,
          "en": "for these controls here, which I have in my form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.51,
          "end": 51.48,
          "en": "And therefore, I'll again, generate a new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 54.6,
          "en": "in that shared folder, which I'll name control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.6,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "because it should be a form control in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 61.623,
          "en": "It should be a component that outputs some form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 65.58,
          "en": "Now, I forgot to add skip tests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 69.24,
          "en": "which is why I have this test file here, which I'll remove.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.24,
          "end": 73.35,
          "en": "And I'll now work on this control.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.35,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "And my idea with that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 79.95,
          "en": "is that we grab such a paragraph, which contains a label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.95,
          "end": 84.95,
          "en": "and an input or a text area, and we copy that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 86.91,
          "en": "and we use that as a template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.91,
          "end": 90.033,
          "en": "in the control.component template HTML file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.56,
          "end": 93.84,
          "en": "But, of course, now both the label text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 97.11,
          "en": "as well as the input is dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.11,
          "end": 99.53999999999999,
          "en": "and should be settable from outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.53999999999999,
          "end": 102.303,
          "en": "to make this control.component reusable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.34,
          "end": 107.78999999999999,
          "en": "Now, for the label, I'll use an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.78999999999999,
          "end": 111.63,
          "en": "We could also use ng-content and select different things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.63,
          "end": 113.52000000000001,
          "en": "but to mix things up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 116.28,
          "en": "and since it's just a short, simple string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.28,
          "end": 120.39,
          "en": "I'll use an input here, but either approach would be fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.39,
          "end": 124.02,
          "en": "So here in the ControlComponent class, we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.02,
          "end": 127.62,
          "en": "and should register an input either with @Input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.62,
          "end": 130.65,
          "en": "as you learned, or through the input function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.65,
          "end": 132.303,
          "en": "which is what I'll use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 136.02,
          "en": "And I'll name my input label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.02,
          "end": 138.813,
          "en": "and then call that input function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.65,
          "end": 142.32,
          "en": "And actually, this should be a required input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.32,
          "end": 143.853,
          "en": "where I'll get a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.073,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "And then in the ControlComponent template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 151.95,
          "en": "instead of outputting the hard-coded text Title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.95,
          "end": 154.62,
          "en": "I wanna use string interpolation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.62,
          "end": 158.25,
          "en": "and output my label input value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 161.19,
          "en": "And since I'm using the input function, it's a signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.19,
          "end": 164.61,
          "en": "and I need to add those parentheses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.61,
          "end": 167.34,
          "en": "If I would use the @Input decorator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 171.51,
          "en": "you would not add them, but with signals, you need them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.51,
          "end": 174.81,
          "en": "But what about this input element here now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 177.24,
          "en": "It has a name and an id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 177.24,
          "end": 181.32,
          "en": "and it might receive even input-specific attributes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.32,
          "end": 182.283,
          "en": "in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "Therefore, of course, we could start accepting them all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 187.86,
          "en": "as inputs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.86,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "But we would potentially end up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 193.47,
          "en": "with a pretty long list of inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.47,
          "end": 197.46,
          "en": "And whenever we wanted to make a new attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.46,
          "end": 200.16,
          "en": "of this input element configurable, we would have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.16,
          "end": 202.683,
          "en": "to add a new input to the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.64,
          "end": 205.77,
          "en": "In addition, it's not always an input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.77,
          "end": 207.36,
          "en": "which I wanna output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.36,
          "end": 211.023,
          "en": "Instead, I also have a textarea here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 214.5,
          "en": "so that therefore screams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.5,
          "end": 218.37,
          "en": "for ng-content here in the control.component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.37,
          "end": 222.18,
          "en": "because ng-content allows us to insert any kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 222.18,
          "end": 226.53,
          "en": "of markup here into this component from inside the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 226.53,
          "end": 229.023,
          "en": "where we're using this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.94,
          "end": 234.96,
          "en": "However, I actually wanna be a bit restrictive regarding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 234.96,
          "end": 239.5,
          "en": "what can be inserted here, and I'll use select for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.54,
          "end": 244.77,
          "en": "because you cannot just use this select property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 244.77,
          "end": 248.88,
          "en": "on ng-content if you have multiple ng-contents,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.88,
          "end": 250.89,
          "en": "though that is a common use case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.89,
          "end": 252.6,
          "en": "But you can also use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.6,
          "end": 256.83,
          "en": "to be well, selective about which kind of content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.83,
          "end": 261.39,
          "en": "can be projected into one of your components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.39,
          "end": 264.72,
          "en": "to make sure that it's not used in an incorrect way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 264.72,
          "end": 267.243,
          "en": "or that it at least doesn't work then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 268.26,
          "end": 271.23,
          "en": "So here I wanna select input elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 271.23,
          "end": 275.973,
          "en": "and textarea elements, and that is new.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 276.93,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "You can specify multiple selectors here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 280.95,
          "end": 282.753,
          "en": "separated by a comma.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 283.95,
          "end": 287.493,
          "en": "And here I have multiple element selectors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.93,
          "end": 291.87,
          "en": "You could, by the way, do something similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 291.87,
          "end": 293.493,
          "en": "for component selectors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 294.33,
          "end": 298.5,
          "en": "Here if we maybe also want to support anchor tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 298.5,
          "end": 301.6,
          "en": "with appButton on them, we could add a comma",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 302.58,
          "end": 306.933,
          "en": "and add this selector here to the list of selectors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.4,
          "end": 310.62,
          "en": "So for component selectors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 310.62,
          "end": 313.59,
          "en": "and for ng-content select,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 313.59,
          "end": 316.17,
          "en": "you can specify multiple selectors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 316.17,
          "end": 318.123,
          "en": "by separating them with a comma.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 320.85,
          "end": 323.85,
          "en": "And I'll leave that selector list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 323.85,
          "end": 325.44,
          "en": "for my button.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 325.44,
          "end": 327.93,
          "en": "even though I don't use any anchor tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 327.93,
          "end": 330.27,
          "en": "with appButton in this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 330.27,
          "end": 333.65999999999997,
          "en": "just so that you see that you can also have lists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 333.65999999999997,
          "end": 335.103,
          "en": "of selectors here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 337.83,
          "end": 339.48,
          "en": "But back to the control.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 339.48,
          "end": 343.29,
          "en": "I'm now using this feature to make sure that only inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 343.29,
          "end": 345.33,
          "en": "or textareas are selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 345.33,
          "end": 348.633,
          "en": "and any other content doesn't end up in this template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 350.15999999999997,
          "end": 354.54,
          "en": "Well, and with that, we can now use this control.component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 354.54,
          "end": 358.51,
          "en": "We can go to the new-ticket.component.html file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 359.61,
          "end": 362.94,
          "en": "and replace this paragraph here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 362.94,
          "end": 367.383,
          "en": "with app-control also for the closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 368.88,
          "end": 371.82,
          "en": "And now we must import this ControlComponent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 371.82,
          "end": 373.14300000000003,
          "en": "to make it available here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 374.01,
          "end": 378.153,
          "en": "And we also must set this label property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 378.99,
          "end": 381.87,
          "en": "And since I wanna set it to a string value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 381.87,
          "end": 384.09,
          "en": "I'll not use square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 384.09,
          "end": 386.07,
          "en": "because I don't need the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 386.07,
          "end": 388.77,
          "en": "of some dynamic TypeScript expression here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 388.77,
          "end": 391.63,
          "en": "Instead, I'll just set this to a label of title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 393.03,
          "end": 396.97,
          "en": "and we can, and should now remove that label here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 398.25,
          "end": 399.69,
          "en": "because we don't need it anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 399.69,
          "end": 404.67,
          "en": "I will keep the input though with all its settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 404.67,
          "end": 407.85,
          "en": "Well, and it's now the same for the text area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 407.85,
          "end": 412,
          "en": "I'll replace this paragraph with app-control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 412.89,
          "end": 416.163,
          "en": "and set the label property to Request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 418.14,
          "end": 420.36,
          "en": "Also replace the closing paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 420.36,
          "end": 424.503,
          "en": "and get rid of that label here, but keep the textarea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 426.27,
          "end": 428.61,
          "en": "And with that, if you save that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 428.61,
          "end": 433.29,
          "en": "and you go back, you'll see the same form as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 433.29,
          "end": 435.12,
          "en": "but it's now rendered with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 435.12,
          "end": 438.21,
          "en": "of our custom app ControlComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 438.21,
          "end": 440.58299999999997,
          "en": "as you can see, if you inspect the markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 441.66,
          "end": 445.35,
          "en": "And in there we got this paragraph, and then that label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 445.35,
          "end": 446.823,
          "en": "and that input.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
